{"title": "漏掉 postrotate：新请求消失", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "# 删除 postrotate/endscript 段后再强制轮转"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "logrotate -f -s /tmp/lr.state2 /etc/logrotate.d/nginx-nop"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s localhost >/dev/null && wc -c /var/log/nginx/access.log"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "0 /var/log/nginx/access.log"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "请求明明发出，新日志却是 0 字节——凭空消失"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "nginx 还握着旧句柄，日志写进幽灵 inode，空间也不释放"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
